WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Citrus for Windows. Convert files. Keep your flow.

00:04.000 --> 00:10.000
An edited demonstration of the current native wheel. Drag a file, tap Shift, and choose a format. The original stays in place.

00:10.000 --> 00:16.000
The native photo editor adjusts the sample photograph. Add BG frames it with a background and saves a separate output.

00:16.000 --> 00:24.000
The native Trim Video editor shows real playback. Orange handles choose the part to keep, with a simple playable preview.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
Citrus preview for Windows x64. See the download page for the current release, requirements and limitations.

